362		 * full keyboard parity provided elsewhere (global arrow/zoom/Escape shortcuts on
363		 * <svelte:window> and the Tab-reachable zoom buttons). There is no ARIA role that
364		 * accurately models a custom zoom/pan surface, so attaching the listeners via an
